// The k8s-gpui keymap.
//
// User overrides for the selected keymap file. This file is loaded after the
// built-in default keymap and the selected preset, so later bindings win.
// JSONC supports comments and trailing commas.
//
// Contexts used by the built-in keymap are Shell, CommandPalette, Table,
// Inspector, Hotbar, Terminal, Editor, TextInput, ResourceSearch, Dialog, and
// menu. Terminal owns a focused session, Editor and TextInput own typing, the
// Inspector owns the selected object's YAML and its Describe values, and
// ResourceSearch, Dialog, and menu own an open overlay. A binding with no
// "context" is global.
//
// Open the command palette (secondary-shift-p) and run "Reload Keymap" after editing.
[
  {
    "context": "Shell && !CommandPalette",
    "bindings": {
      // "secondary-shift-e": "k8s_shell::ToggleLeftPanel"
    }
  },
  {
    "context": "Table && !CommandPalette",
    "bindings": {
      // "secondary-d": "k8s_table::OpenDetails"
    }
  }
]
